---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const pageTitle = "Privacy Policy & Terms of Service | EV Charger One";
const pageDescription = "Comprehensive privacy policy, legal disclaimers, TCPA phone consent terms, and domain operator verification for EV Charger One in Central Oregon.";
---

<BaseLayout title={pageTitle} description={pageDescription}>
  <section class="py-16 bg-white border-b border-brand-slate-200 grid-bg">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <span class="mono-tag mb-3">// LEGAL TERMS & DATA PROTECTION</span>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-black text-brand-slate-900 tracking-tight mb-4">
        Privacy Policy & Operating Terms
      </h1>
      <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-brand-slate-600 font-medium mb-3">
        Last updated: August 7, 2026. EV Charger One is committed to maintaining strict data privacy, TCPA compliance, and consumer protection for all lead inquiries and call dispatches.
      </p>
      <div class="bg-emerald-50 border border-emerald-300 rounded-xl p-4 text-xs sm:text-sm text-emerald-950 font-bold shadow-sm">
        🛡️ Domain Ownership & Site Operator Verification: EV Charger One | Operating Manager: Prashant Kumar Vaishnav | Verified Date: August 7, 2026
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-16 bg-brand-slate-50">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 space-y-6 text-slate-800 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">
      
      <!-- Section 1 -->
      <div class="bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-sm">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">1. Information Collection & Purpose</h2>
        <p class="mb-3">
          EV Charger One ("Website", "We", "Us") collects personal information submitted voluntarily by users through online quote request forms or telephonic inquiries. Information collected may include: name, telephone number, email address, service location address, vehicle make/model, and electrical panel specifications.
        </p>
        <p>
          This data is used solely to evaluate service requirements and match homeowners with independent, licensed Oregon electrical contractors (CCB #248910 partner network) who service Deschutes, Crook, and Jefferson counties.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Section 2 -->
      <div class="bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-sm">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">2. Independent Contractor & Matching Service Disclaimer</h2>
        <p class="mb-3">
          <strong>EV Charger One is a web referral matching and lead dispatch platform.</strong> We are not a licensed electrical contracting firm, utility company, or direct employer of field technicians. 
        </p>
        <p>
          All electrical installation, panel capacity upgrades, wiring, and permitting services are performed independently by licensed, insured, and bonded Oregon Construction Contractors Board (CCB) licensed trade professionals. We do not guarantee, warrant, or assume legal liability for specific work outcomes, contractor schedules, or on-site performance.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Section 3 -->
      <div class="bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-sm">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">3. TCPA & E-SIGN Express Telephone Communication Consent</h2>
        <p class="mb-3">
          By submitting a quote request form or initiating a phone call to any listed phone number on this website (including (888) 217-4060), you provide your express written consent under the Telephone Consumer Protection Act (TCPA, 47 U.S.C. § 227) and the E-SIGN Act to receive communications.
        </p>
        <p>
          You agree that EV Charger One and its matched licensed electrical contractor partners may contact you via telephone calls, automated dialing systems, artificial voice messages, or SMS text messages at the phone number provided regarding your Level 2 EV charger inquiry. Consent is not a mandatory condition of purchasing any product or service.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Section 4 -->
      <div class="bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-sm">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">4. Limitation of Liability & Warranty Disclaimer</h2>
        <p class="mb-3">
          To the maximum extent permitted by applicable law, EV Charger One, its site operators, and officers (including Prashant Kumar Vaishnav) shall not be liable for any direct, indirect, incidental, consequential, or punitive damages arising from site usage, referral routing, or electrical installation services executed by independent third-party contractors.
        </p>
        <p>
          All technical guides, electrical code summaries (NEC Article 625), and rebate information provided on this website are for general informational purposes only and do not constitute formal engineering advice.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Section 5 -->
      <div class="bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-sm">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">5. Data Protection & Non-Sale of Contact Details</h2>
        <p>
          We maintain strict organizational and technical security measures to protect consumer data. We do not sell, lease, trade, or distribute your personal contact information to unverified third-party data brokers or spam marketing lists. Lead inquiries are routed strictly to verified electrical contractors assigned to your Oregon service area.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Section 6 -->
      <div class="bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-sm">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">6. Cookies, Analytics & Third-Party Metrics</h2>
        <p>
          This website utilizes Google Analytics 4 (Property ID: G-QZT2JJ7QXP) and standard browser cookies to monitor aggregate website traffic, page performance, and user engagement metrics (such as click-to-call conversions). Cookies do not collect sensitive personally identifiable information and may be disabled via your web browser settings.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Section 7 -->
      <div class="bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-sm">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">7. Consumer Privacy Rights & Data Deletion Requests</h2>
        <p class="mb-3">
          Depending on your jurisdiction, you have the right to access, rectify, or request the permanent deletion of your submitted personal contact data from our active systems.
        </p>
        <p>
          To exercise your privacy rights, request data deletion, or opt out of future communications, please submit a written request to our Data Privacy Desk at <strong>venturevidyahindi@gmail.com</strong> with the subject line <em>"Data Privacy / Deletion Request"</em>.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Section 8 -->
      <div class="bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-sm">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">8. Governing Law & Contact Information</h2>
        <p class="mb-4">
          These Privacy Policy terms shall be governed by and construed in accordance with the laws of the State of Oregon, United States, without regard to its conflict of law principles.
        </p>
        <div class="border-t border-slate-200 pt-4 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700">
          <p><strong>Site Operator:</strong> EV Charger One (Prashant Kumar Vaishnav)</p>
          <p><strong>Official Contact Email:</strong> venturevidyahindi@gmail.com</p>
          <p><strong>Operating Hours:</strong> Mon-Sun 7:00 AM - 8:00 PM PST</p>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
